=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">/bin/signal-cli&quot;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> /usr/local/bin/</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Generate a linking URI (displays a QR code or link)</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">signal-cli </span><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">link</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">-n</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\" style=\"color:rgb(255, 121, 198)\">&quot;HermesAgent&quot;</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Replace +1234567890 with your Signal phone number (E.164 format)</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">signal-cli </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--account</span><span class=\"token plain\"> +1234567890 daemon </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">--http</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">127.0</span><span class=\"token plain\">.0.1:8080</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token function\" style=\"color:rgb(80, 250, 123)\">curl</span><span class=\"token plain\"> http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/check</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Should return: {&quot;versions&quot;:{&quot;signal-cli&quot;:...}}</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\">hermes gateway setup</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Required</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token assign-left variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">SIGNAL_HTTP_URL</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\">http://127.0.0.1:8080</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token assign-left variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">SIGNAL_ACCOUNT</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\">+1234567890</span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Security (recommended)</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token assign-left variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">SIGNAL_ALLOWED_USERS</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\">+1234567890,+0987654321    </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Comma-separated E.164 numbers or UUIDs</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Optional</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token assign-left variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">SIGNAL_GROUP_ALLOWED_USERS</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\">groupId1,groupId2     </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Enable groups (omit to disable, * for all)</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span><br></div><div class=\"token-line\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token assign-left variable\" style=\"color:rgb(189, 147, 249);font-style:italic\">SIGNAL_HOME_CHANNEL</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\">+1234567890                  </span><span class=\"token comment\" style=\"color:rgb(98, 114, 164)\"># Default delivery target for cron jobs</span><br></div></code></pre>","<pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\" style=\"color:#F8F8F2;background-colo